Package: vivobook-fan-control
Version: 1.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: haze <85500705+NevamindHaze@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, pkexec | policykit-1
Homepage: https://github.com/NevamindHaze/vivobook-fan-control
Description: Auto and Full fan switch for the ASUS VivoBook X412DA
 A small window with live graphs of CPU temperature, fan RPM, CPU load and
 CPU clock, and an immediate switch between Auto and Full. The fan returns
 to Auto when the app closes.
